Quetzal_Text_836622C::
	.string "Start multiplayer from the\n"
	.string "START menu! Choose MPLAYER.\p"
	.string "Two to four players can connect.\n"
	.string "Choose the same player count\l"
	.string "and follow the connection prompts.\p"
	.string "Once connected, open MPLAYER\n"
	.string "again to see its features.\p"
	.string "When you finish, choose DISCONNECT\n"
	.string "from that same menu.$"

Quetzal_Text_8366334::
	.string "To trade, connect two players\n"
	.string "and open MPLAYER from\l"
	.string "the START menu.\p"
	.string "Choose the trade option.\n"
	.string "Each player needs at least\l"
	.string "two POKéMON in their party.\p"
	.string "Your game and cheat modes must\n"
	.string "match. Challenges may prevent\l"
	.string "some trades.\p"
	.string "In Nuzlocke, your trade clause\n"
	.string "must allow trading.$"

Quetzal_Text_8366445::
	.string "To battle other players, open\n"
	.string "MPLAYER from the START menu\l"
	.string "and choose the battle option.\p"
	.string "Two players can choose\n"
	.string "Single or Double Battles.\l"
	.string "Multi Battles need four players.\p"
	.string "You can also team up against\n"
	.string "adventure trainers when the game\l"
	.string "allows a COOP battle.\p"
	.string "Check its settings in OPTIONS:\n"
	.string "you can enable COOP battles\l"
	.string "and adjust their experience.$"

Quetzal_Text_840FC22::
	.string "...$"

Quetzal_Text_8427B47::
	.string "A secret switch!\p"
	.string "Press it?$"

Quetzal_Text_8427B62::
	.string "Who wouldn’t?$"

Quetzal_Text_8427B70::
	.string "Not quite yet!$"

Quetzal_Text_842FD3B::
	.string "Okay, everything’s in order.\p"
	.string "SEAGALLOP HI-SPEED 7 will be\n"
	.string "departing immediately.$"

Quetzal_Text_8431905::
	.string "Choose a destination (up/down).\n"
	.string "A: Sail  B: Cancel$"

Quetzal_Text_843561B::
	.string "SNORLAX woke up!\p"
	.string "It attacked in a grumpy rage!$"

Quetzal_Text_843564A::
	.string "SNORLAX calmed down.\n"
	.string "It gave a huge yawn…\l"
	.string "And returned to the mountains.$"

Quetzal_Text_8435693::
	.string "Want to use the POKé FLUTE?$"

Quetzal_Text_84356AF::
	.string "{PLAYER} played the POKé FLUTE.$"

Quetzal_Text_843E142::
	.string "BLUE: Yeah!\n"
	.string "Am I great or what?$"

Quetzal_Text_8440C0A::
	.string "You don’t have space for this.$"

Quetzal_Text_8442CD8::
	.string "A shiny new BICYCLE!$"

Quetzal_Text_845581F::
	.string "{PLAYER} put away\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}.\l"
	.string "Pocket: {STR_VAR_3}.$"

Quetzal_Text_845584C::
	.string "Too bad!\n"
	.string "The BAG is full…$"

Quetzal_Text_8455A2F::
	.string "Only truly skilled TRAINERS are\n"
	.string "allowed through.\p"
	.string "You don’t have the {STR_VAR_1}\n"
	.string "yet!$"

Quetzal_Text_8455A7B::
	.string "Rules are rules.\n"
	.string "I can’t let you pass.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455AA2::
	.string "Oh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
	.string "Go right ahead.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455AC6::
	.string "You can pass here only if you have\n"
	.string "the {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
	.string "You don’t have the {STR_VAR_1}\n"
	.string "yet.\p"
	.string "You have to have it to get to\n"
	.string "the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455B3E::
	.string "You can pass here only if you have\n"
	.string "the {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
	.string "Oh! That is the {STR_VAR_1}!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM 0x016F}{PAUSE 0x60}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
	.string "Okay, then.\n"
	.string "Please, go right ahead.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455BAC::
	.string "In KANTO, you have registered\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} species as caught.\p"
	.string "To receive {STR_VAR_2},\n"
	.string "you need {STR_VAR_1} species.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455C04::
	.string "When you register {STR_VAR_1} species\n"
	.string "as caught in KANTO,\p"
	.string "come back for the {STR_VAR_2}.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455C4B::
	.string "Oh! I see you don’t have any\n"
	.string "room for the {STR_VAR_2}.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455C79::
	.string "I’m looking for the POKéMON\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
	.string "Wanna trade one for my\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}?$"

Quetzal_Text_8455CB4::
	.string "Awww!\n"
	.string "Oh, well…$"

Quetzal_Text_8455CC4::
	.string "What?\n"
	.string "That’s no {STR_VAR_1}!$"

Quetzal_Text_8455CD8::
	.string "Hey, thanks!$"

Quetzal_Text_8455CE5::
	.string "Isn’t my old {STR_VAR_2} great?$"

Quetzal_Text_8455CFC::
	.string "Hello, there! Do you happen to\n"
	.string "have a {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
	.string "Would you agree to a trade for\n"
	.string "my {STR_VAR_2}?$"

Quetzal_Text_8455D4C::
	.string "Well, if you don’t want to…$"

Quetzal_Text_8455D68::
	.string "Hmmm?\n"
	.string "This isn’t a {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
	.string "Think of me if you get one.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455D9B::
	.string "Thanks!$"

Quetzal_Text_8455DA3::
	.string "The {STR_VAR_2} that I traded you,\n"
	.string "has it grown stronger?$"

Quetzal_Text_8455DD4::
	.string "Hi!\n"
	.string "Do you have a {STR_VAR_1}?\p"
	.string "Want to trade it for my\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}?$"

Quetzal_Text_8455E06::
	.string "That’s too bad.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455E16::
	.string "…This is no {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
	.string "If you get one, trade it with me.$"

Quetzal_Text_8455E48::
	.string "Thanks, you’re a pal!$"

Quetzal_Text_8455E5E::
	.string "How is my old {STR_VAR_2}?\n"
	.string "My {STR_VAR_1} is doing great!$"

Quetzal_Text_8455E86::
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\n"
	.string "Someone’s PC.\p"
	.string "It was placed in \n"
	.string "BOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"

Quetzal_Text_8455EC6::
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\n"
	.string "BILL’S PC.\p"
	.string "It was placed in \n"
	.string "BOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"

Quetzal_Text_8455F03::
	.string "BOX “{STR_VAR_3}” on\n"
	.string "Someone’s PC was full.\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\n"
	.string "BOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"

Quetzal_Text_8455F46::
	.string "BOX “{STR_VAR_3}” on\n"
	.string "BILL’S PC was full.\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} was transferred to\n"
	.string "BOX “{STR_VAR_1}.”$"

Quetzal_Text_8455FC6::
	.string "There’s no more room for POKéMON!\p"
	.string "The POKéMON BOXES are full and\n"
	.string "can’t accept any more!$"

Quetzal_Text_84563A6::
	.string "Hi, there!\n"
	.string "May I help you?$"

Quetzal_Text_8456559::
	.string "To visit ISLANDS 4, 5, 6, and 7,\n"
	.string "you must win the KANTO LEAGUE.$"

Quetzal_Text_84565AD::
	.string "All right!\n"
	.string "All aboard SEAGALLOP HI-SPEED {STR_VAR_1}!$"

Quetzal_Text_84565DA::
	.string "Please come again!$"

Quetzal_Text_84565ED::
	.string "Which floor do you want?$"

Quetzal_Text_84566B6::
	.string "Okay, I’ll take your POKéMON for a\n"
	.string "few seconds.$"

Quetzal_Text_84566E6::
	.string "We hope to see you again!$"

Quetzal_Text_8456700::
	.string "Thank you for waiting.\n"
	.string "We’ve restored your POKéMON to\l"
	.string "full health.$"

Quetzal_Text_845675A::
	.string "Do you want to give a nickname to\n"
	.string "this {STR_VAR_1}?$"

Quetzal_Text_8456785::
	.string "Bingo!\n"
	.string "The CARD KEY opened the door!$"

Quetzal_Text_84567AA::
	.string "No!\n"
	.string "It needs a CARD KEY!$"

Quetzal_Text_8456876::
	.string "The door is open…$"

Quetzal_Text_8456888::
	.string "The {STR_VAR_1} flew away!$"

Quetzal_Text_846B47A::
	.string "This tree looks like it can be CUT\n"
	.string "down!\p"
	.string "Would you like to CUT it?$"

Quetzal_Text_846B4C9::
	.string "This tree looks like it can be CUT\n"
	.string "down!$"

Quetzal_Text_846B56A::
	.string "This rock appears to be breakable.\n"
